{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 5, "data": [{"docid2": 1729781, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "历史规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/sswgh/lsgh/202111/t20211123_1729781.htm", "content": "\n　　前言\n　　《三明市“十三五”林业发展专项规划》由三明市林业局牵头组织编制。本规划根据党的十八届三中、四中全会和《中共中央 国务院关于加快推进生态文明建设的意见》、《国务院关于支持福建省深入实施生态省", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/sswgh/lsgh/202111/t20211123_1729781.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.23 10:34:00", "doctitle": "三明市“十三五”林业发展专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1843922, "sourcename": "市林业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/sswgh/lsgh/202111/t20211123_1729781.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/sswgh/lsgh/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 283283, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "历史规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/201603/t20160311_283283.htm", "content": "\n　　（2016年1月29日市十二届人大六次会议批准）\n　　目录\n　　前言\n　　第一章谱写加快发展新篇章\n　　第一节发展基础\n　　第二节发展环境\n　　第三节指导思想\n　　第四节发展目标\n　　第二章打造产业转型升级版\n　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/201603/t20160311_283283.htm", "docreltime": "2016.03.11 09:38:00", "doctitle": "三明市国民经济和社会发展第十三个五年规划纲要", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1832871, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/201603/t20160311_283283.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/201603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 225960, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "历史规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/201102/t20110215_225960.htm", "content": "\n　　前 言\n　　“十二五”时期是三明加快转变经济发展方式、推动跨越发展、提前三年全面建成小康社会的关键时期。科学合理编制和有效实施“十二五”规划，对于积极适应新变化、妥善应对新挑战、牢牢抓住新机遇、全面", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/201102/t20110215_225960.htm", "docreltime": "2011.02.15 09:51:00", "doctitle": "三明市国民经济和社会发展第十二个五年规划纲要", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1832870, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/201102/t20110215_225960.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/201102/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 204002, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "历史规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/200808/t20080822_204002.htm", "content": "\n　　本《纲要》以党的十六届五中全会和省委七届十次全会精神为指导，以市委六届十二次全会通过的《中共三明市委关于制定三明市国民经济和社会发展第十一个五年规划的建议》为编制依据。\n　　一、加快崛起的关键时期", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/200808/t20080822_204002.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.22 15:35:00", "doctitle": "三明市国民经济和社会发展第十一个五年规划纲要", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1832869, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/200808/t20080822_204002.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 203999, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "历史规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/200808/t20080822_203999.htm", "content": "\n　　前 言\n　　“九五”计划实施以来，全市人民在市委、市政府的领导下，以邓小平理论和党的十五大精神为指导，加快建立社会主义市场经济体制，深化改革，扩大开放，促进发展，保持稳定，国民经济和社会事业都取得了", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/200808/t20080822_203999.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.22 11:20:00", "doctitle": "三明市国民经济和社会发展第十个五年计划纲要", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1832868, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/200808/t20080822_203999.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/ghgy/200808/", "rels": []}]}